25","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"7000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[33,20,76,77,82,76],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年名士、颍川陈氏代表人物。陈寔幼子，陈纪之弟。与父、兄并称“颍川三君”，每逢朝廷三公府征召，父子三人常同时受到举荐，送礼祝贺的人络绎不绝，当世无比荣耀。以德行高洁、智辩无双、温润如玉著称，是汉末道德与才学的标杆，可惜英年早逝，未能尽显其才。陈纪之子陈群与陈谌之子陈忠曾各论其父功德，争论不休，问于陈寔。陈寔答曰：“元方难为兄，季方难为弟。”意指兄弟二人才德品行难分高下。这便是成语 “难兄难弟” 的典故来源。","tc":"東漢末年名士、潁川陳氏代表人物。陳寔幼子，陳紀之弟。與父、兄并稱“潁川三君”，每逢朝廷三公府征召，父子三人常同時受到舉薦，送禮祝賀的人絡繹不絕，當世無比榮耀。以德行高潔、智辯無雙、溫潤如玉著稱，是漢末道德與才學的標桿，可惜英年早逝，未能盡顯其才。陳紀之子陳群與陳諶之子陳忠曾各論其父功德，爭論不休，問于陳寔。陳寔答曰：“元方難為兄，季方難為弟。”意指兄弟二人才德品行難分高下。這便是成語 “難兄難弟” 的典故來源。","en":"A renowned scholar of the late Eastern Han dynasty and a prominent figure of the Chen clan of Yingchuan. He was the youngest son of Chen Shi and the younger brother of Chen Ji. Along with his father and brother, they were celebrated as the ‘Three Lords of Yingchuan.’ Whenever the Three Excellencies summoned candidates, the father and two sons were often recommended together, drawing an endless stream of congratulatory visitors bearing gifts—an unparalleled honor at the time. Renowned for his noble character, peerless wisdom and eloquence, and gentle demeanor, he stood as a paragon of virtue and intellect in the late Han, though he tragically died young before his full potential could be realized. Once, Chen Ji's son Chen Qun and Chen Chen's son Chen Zhong debated the virtues and Merit of their respective fathers endlessly, turning to Chen Shi to judge. Chen Shi replied: ‘It is hard for Yuanfang to be the elder brother, and hard for Jifang to be the younger brother,’ meaning the two brothers were equally matched in virtue and talent. This became the origin of the idiom ‘a pair of peers.’","jp":"後漢末期の名士であり、潁川陳氏を代表する人物。陳寔の末子で、陳紀の弟。父や兄とともに「潁川三君」と並び称され、朝廷の三公府から徴召があるたびに父子三人が同時に推挙されることも多く、祝賀の使者が引きも切らず、当世において無上の栄誉を誇った。高潔な徳行、無双の知弁、玉のように温雅な人柄で知られ、漢末における道徳と才学の模範と称えられたが、惜しくも早世し、その才能を存分に発揮することはできなかった。陳紀の子である陳群と陳諶の子である陳忠が、かつて互いの父の功徳を論じて決着がつかず陳寔に判断を求めた際、陳寔は「元方は兄と為り難く、季方は弟と為り難し」と答え、兄弟二人の才徳品行に甲乙つけがたいことを示した。これが故事成語「難兄難弟」の由来である。","kr":"동한 말기의 명사이자 영천 진씨를 대표하는 인물이다. 진식의 막내아들이며, 진기의 동생이다. 아버지, 형과 함께 '영천삼군(潁川三君)'이라 불렸으며, 조정의 삼공부(三公府)에서 징모할 때마다 삼부자가 번번이 동시에 천거되어 축하 인사를 건네는 이들이 끊이지 않을 정도로 당대에 견줄 데 없는 영예를 누렸다. 고결한 덕행과 비할 데 없는 지혜와 언변, 옥처럼 온화하고 맑은 인품으로 명망이 높아 한나라 말기 도덕과 재학의 표상으로 꼽혔으나, 안타깝게도 요절하여 그 재능을 온전히 다 펼치지 못했다. 일찍이 진기의 아들 진군과 진심의 아들 진충이 각자 자기 아버지의 공덕을 논하다가 결론을 내지 못하고 진식에게 묻자, 진식은 '원방은 형 노릇 하기가 어렵고, 지방은 아우 노릇 하기가 어렵다(元方難爲兄 季方難爲弟)'라고 답하였다. 이는 두 사람의 재능과 덕행에 우열을 가리기 어렵다는 뜻으로, 이것이 바로 고사성어 '난형난제(難兄難弟)'의 유래이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1029415","remark":"","surname":"陈","surnameTc":"陳","surnameEn":"Chen","surnameJp":"陳","surnameKr":"진","surnameOther":"","name":"谌","nameTc":"諶","nameEn":"Chen","nameJp":"諶","nameKr":"심","nameOther":"","word":"季方","wordTc":"季方","wordEn":"Jifang","wordJp":"季方","wordKr":"계방","wordOther":"","icon":"陈谌","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"0","city":"CS1028","gender":"0","rule":"33","force":"20","wise":"76","politics":"77","charm":"82","will":"76","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"12/32/33/21/32/88/74/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002105","warSoulPoint":"3200","battleSoulPoint":"400","debateSoulPoint":"7800","strategy":"1004208;1007315","strategy2":"1004601","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/1/3/2/0/2/0/2/3/0/0/3/3/0/3/0/1/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/5